The evidence matrix is designed to prevent overclaiming. Each promoted row carries an explicit boundary condition.

*Tiny-net plateau.* On the multiclass action-scoring benchmark, the neural scorer plateaus at small hidden widths. {{C7.summary}}

*Trace determinism.* The trace replay protocol hashes state representations and checks that independent training runs from the same checkpoint produce identical trace hashes. {{C8.summary}}

*Dataset engine evidence surface.* Six dataset adapters produce valid evidence rows under the shared schema. {{C8.dataset_summary}}

*Signal flight.* The Signal integration replays a deterministic flight simulator as verifier, establishing replay-certified rollout trajectories. {{C9.summary}}
